  "reflectionText": "Naomi told Ruth to go back to her mother's house. Ruth said: where you go, I will go. Where you stay, I will stay. Your people shall be my people, and your God my God. Where you die, I will die. Have you ever spoken a vow that bound your future to another's, in a place no one in either of your houses had asked you to go?"
